id=rg477m_bios_check
name=RG477M BIOS check
version=1
versionCode=1
author=atrolle224
description=One-time, read-only: finds BIOS files on internal storage and SD cards, checks PS1, Saturn, Dreamcast and DS BIOS against known good dumps, flags PS2 BIOS files and lists what is missing. Report in Download/477m_bios_report.txt. Removes itself on reboot.
